{"speciesId":292,"names":{"fr":"Munja","es":"Shedinja","en":"Shedinja","ja":"ヌケニン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SHEDINJA’s hard body doesn’t move - not even a twitch. In fact, its body appears to be merely a hollow shell. It is believed that this POKéMON will steal the spirit of anyone peering into its hollow body from its back."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SHEDINJA is a peculiar POKéMON. It seems to appear unsought in a POKé BALL after a NINCADA evolves. This bizarre POKéMON is entirely immobile - it doesn’t even breathe."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A peculiar POKéMON that floats in air even though its wings remain completely still. The inside of its body is hollow and utterly dark."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"A most peculiar POKéMON that somehow appears in a POKé BALL when a NINCADA evolves."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"A most peculiar POKéMON that somehow appears in a POKé BALL when a NINCADA evolves."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"A discarded bug shell that came to life. Peering into the crack on its back is said to steal one’s spirit."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"A discarded bug shell that came to life. Peering into the crack on its back is said to steal one’s spirit."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"A discarded bug shell that came to life. Peering into the crack on its back is said to steal one’s spirit."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"A strange Pokémon--it flies without moving its wings, has a hollow shell for a body, and does not breathe."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"A strange Pokémon--it flies without moving its wings, has a hollow shell for a body, and does not breathe."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Une carapace d’insecte laissée à l’abandon. On dit qu’il vole l’âme de celui qui regarde à l’intérieur."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"A discarded bug shell that came to life. Peering into the crack on its back is said to steal one’s spirit."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Une carapace d’insecte laissée à l’abandon. On dit qu’il vole l’âme de celui qui regarde à l’intérieur."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A discarded bug shell that came to life. Peering into the crack on its back is said to steal one’s spirit."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"A discarded bug shell that came to life. Peering into the crack on its back is said to steal one’s spirit."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"A discarded bug shell that came to life. Peering into the crack on its back is said to steal one’s spirit."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Une carapace d’insecte laissée à l’abandon. On dit qu’il vole l’âme de celui qui regarde à l’intérieur."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Es el caparazón de un bicho que cobró vida. Si alguien lo mira por la espalda, le robará el alma."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"A discarded bug shell that came to life. Peering into the crack on its back is said to steal one’s spirit."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"抜け殻が 魂を 宿した。 背中の すきまから のぞきこむと 魂を 吸われてしまうらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Un Pokémon étrange que l’on trouve dans les Poké Balls après l’évolution d’un Ningale."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Es un Pokémon muy peculiar; aparece de repente en una Poké Ball cuando Nincada evoluciona."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"A most peculiar Pokémon that somehow appears in a Poké Ball when a Nincada evolves."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"ツチニンが 進化する ときに いつの間にか モンスターボールに 入っている 不思議な ポケモンだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Le corps robuste de Munja ne bouge pas d’un pouce. En fait, son corps semble être une coquille vide. Certains croient que ce Pokémon peut voler l’âme de quiconque regarderait à l’intérieur de son corps creux."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Shedinja tiene un cuerpo robusto que no mueve en absoluto. De hecho, parece una especie de caparazón hueco. Se cree que, si alguien se atreviera a mirarle por la espalda lo que tiene en su interior, Shedinja le robaría el alma."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Shedinja’s hard body doesn’t move—not even a twitch. In fact, its body appears to be merely a hollow shell. It is believed that this Pokémon will steal the spirit of anyone peering into its hollow body from its back."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"硬い 体は ぴくりとも 動かない。 背中から 体の 空洞を のぞくと 魂を 吸い取られると 信じられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Munja est un étrange Pokémon. Il semble apparaître sans raison dans une Poké Ball après l’évolution d’un Ningale. Ce Pokémon bizarre est totalement immobile. Il ne respire même pas."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Shedinja es un Pokémon peculiar. Según parece, surge por las buenas en una Poké Ball cuando Nincada evoluciona. Este raro Pokémon no se mueve nada; ni siquiera respira."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Shedinja is a peculiar Pokémon. It seems to appear unsought in a Poké Ball after a Nincada evolves. This bizarre Pokémon is entirely immobile—it doesn’t even breathe."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"ツチニンが 進化したとき なぜか 勝手に モンスターボールに 入っている ポケモンだ。 体は まったく 動かず 息も しない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Un Pokémon étrange que l’on trouve dans une Poké Ball après l’évolution d’un Ningale."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Es un Pokémon muy peculiar; aparece de repente en una Poké Ball cuando Nincada evoluciona."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"A most peculiar Pokémon that somehow appears in a Poké Ball when a Nincada evolves."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"ツチニンが 進化する ときに いつの間にか モンスターボールに 入っている 不思議な ポケモンだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Cet étrange Pokémon, dont le corps est comme une coquille vide, ne respire pas et peut voler sans battre des ailes."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Es un Pokémon muy peculiar: revolotea sin batir las alas, no respira y su cuerpo está hueco por dentro."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"A strange Pokémon—it flies without moving its wings, has a hollow shell for a body, and does not breathe."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"ハネを 動かさずに 飛びまわる。 体の 中は 空っぽで 息を しない 不思議な ポケモン。"}],"varieties":[{"id":292,"moves":[{"name":"scratch","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[5,"level-up",9],[6,"level-up",9],[7,"level-up",9],[8,"level-up",9],[9,"level-up",9],[10,"level-up",9],[11,"level-up",9],[12,"level-up",9],[13,"level-up",9],[14,"level-up",9],[15,"level-up",9],[16,"level-up",9],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",9],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",9],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"absorb","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",5],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",5],[20,"level-up",23],[23,"level-up",23]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"m